# Offline frontend (Phase 6 — branch phone UX)

Branch pages under `/branch/…` use a Service Worker + IndexedDB layer. Warehouse `/manage/…` consoles stay **online-only**.

## Files

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| [`branches/static/branches/js/db.js`](branches/static/branches/js/db.js) | IndexedDB: `catalog_items`, `catalog_meta`, `pending_requests` |
| [`branches/static/branches/js/branch_catalog.js`](branches/static/branches/js/branch_catalog.js) | Fetch API, save cache, offline fallback |
| [`branches/static/branches/js/branch_bootstrap.js`](branches/static/branches/js/branch_bootstrap.js) | Shared offline banner + auto-sync on all branch pages |
| [`branches/static/branches/js/sync_queue.js`](branches/static/branches/js/sync_queue.js) | Replay offline requisição drafts to `POST /api/branch/requests/sync/` |
| [`orders/static/orders/js/branch_requests.js`](orders/static/orders/js/branch_requests.js) | Branch requisição UI + offline draft queue |
| [`branches/static/branches/js/register_sw.js`](branches/static/branches/js/register_sw.js) | Service Worker registration |
| [`branches/static/branches/js/offline_logout.js`](branches/static/branches/js/offline_logout.js) | Clears IndexedDB on Sign out |
| [`branches/templates/branches/service_worker.js`](branches/templates/branches/service_worker.js) | SW template — served at `/service-worker.js` |

## Rules

- Service Worker at `/service-worker.js` (root scope)
- Do **not** cache `/api/` in the Service Worker — API failure triggers IndexedDB fallback in page JS
- `/branch/` **HTML** is **network-first** (fresh page when online; cache only if the network fails). Do not serve stale `data-branch-id` / identity while online.
- Cache-first is for `/static/` (and precached APP_SHELL assets) only
- Bump `CACHE_NAME` in `service_worker.js` when app shell files change
- Include shell scripts in `APP_SHELL` (including `register_sw.js`, `branch_bootstrap.js`)
- `isBypassed` must skip `/api/`, `/accounts/`, `/admin/`, and `/manage/`
- IndexedDB stores downloaded catalogue + pending offline drafts — not warehouse master data
- PostgreSQL remains the source of truth
- Bump `?v=` on every static reference in branch templates when JS/CSS changes
